<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer sees higher operating, net for 1996.</title>
<headline>Sulzer sees higher operating, net for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sulzer AG said it expected higher group operating and net profits for the whole of 1996.</p>
<p>In a statement released with its half-year results, it said: &quot;For 1996, Sulzer expects higher operating and net income than in the previous year.&quot;</p>
<p>Sulzer reported a 1995 net profit of 92 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>It reported a 1995 operating profit for 1995 of 173 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
